# The GC trims one entry past the snapshot's coverage.
MODULE: NoTrimPastAckedTrimPastCoverage
TARGET: NoTrimPastAcked
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the GC trims the entry just above the snapshot's coverage
PERTURBS: GcTrim

--- FIND
    /\ floor <= snapCov

--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: one entry past the coverage.
    /\ floor <= snapCov + 1

--- END
